  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>대부분의 교과서에서 위 내용이 학생들이 직접 광합성에 영향을 미치는 요인을 찾은 뒤에</p><p>실험을 스스로 설계하고, 조절 변인과 통제 변인을 찾아보도록 되어 있는데,</p><p>이게 우리 학교 학생들에게는 다소 어려울 것 같아 이를 도와주는 웹앱을 제작해보았습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>선생님들의 수업에 도움이 되길 바랄게요!!</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/afcd91a413647f18cb2b8d74b2e0bc3c29d7ef19?download\" data-file-name=\"광합성_환경요인_수업웹앱.html\" data-file-size=\"71259\" data-mimetype=\"text/html\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1453%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20261001150932&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fafcd91a413647f18cb2b8d74b2e0bc3c29d7ef19')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">광합성_환경요인_수업웹앱</span><span class=\"type\">.html</span></div><div class=\"size\">69.59KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7b9e2817c2b5c9d0ccf1f2b0c9fcc7de27d73a3?download\" data-file-name=\"광합성_환경요인_학습지_교사용.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2441659\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1453%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20261001150932&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc7b9e2817c2b5c9d0ccf1f2b0c9fcc7de27d73a3')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">광합성_환경요인_학습지_교사용</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.33MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f8b167aa66c8ed26128c66407e4be53964464cf?download\" data-file-name=\"광합성_환경요인_학습지_학생용.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2165771\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldi